y hand's flexibility by maintaining both the Character suit sequence (W6-W7-W8) and the strong Bamboo suit structure (T4-T5-T5-T5-T6), allowing multiple winning tile possibilities while keeping the W4 pair.\n\nAnswer: Play F3"}
